    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planetbase 2</strong> is not just the sequel to the original <strong>Planetbase</strong>, but also the spiritual successor to <strong>Dawn of Man</strong>. The game is currently work in progress and we expect to launch in early 2027. You can follow our <strong>devlog</strong> on <strong>X</strong> or <strong>Bluesky</strong> (see links on the right hand side).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Please note all images and video are work in progress and not representative of the final quality of the product.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colonize The Solar System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colonize <strong>Mars</strong>, <strong>The Moon</strong> and other worlds of the <strong>Solar System</strong>. Each world posing a different and increasingly difficult challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine and Manufacture</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of in-situ resources in order to build a self sustaining colony. Harvest <strong>regolith</strong>, mine <strong>metals</strong>, establish <strong>manufacturing</strong> industries and do whatever it takes for your colony to <strong>survive</strong> and <strong>thrive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509420/extras/4956f566f935575545e673f784d71554.poster.avif?t=1753260847\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509420/extras/4956f566f935575545e673f784d71554.webm?t=1753260847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509420/extras/4956f566f935575545e673f784d71554.mp4?t=1753260847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harness the power of Nature</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect energy from whatever sources are available in each world. Develop the systems required to harvest and store energy from <strong>The Sun</strong>, <strong>Wind</strong>, <strong>Nuclear</strong> and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research Technologies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock both <strong>local</strong> and <strong>Earth-based</strong> technologies in order to build <strong>larger</strong> and <strong>more efficient colonies</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Construct Vehicles and Robots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manufacture or import <strong>vehicles</strong> and <strong>robots</strong> that will aid with the hardest tasks in the settlement and will increase your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509420/extras/0f25599eafcb1f867c94d7cdabbc38a7.avif?t=1753260847\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Layered Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated systems will allow you to manage your colony <strong>without micromanagement</strong> most of the time. However when the need arises you will be able to give <strong>specific commands</strong> to individuals, so they do what you need them to. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolved Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine a game with all the features of <strong>Planetbase</strong>, <strong>Dawn of Man</strong> and more. In particular we plan to add a <strong>tech tree</strong>, <strong>vehicles</strong>, and the ability to create <strong>separate bases</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planetbase 2</strong> is not just the sequel to the original <strong>Planetbase</strong>, but also the spiritual successor to <strong>Dawn of Man</strong>. The game is currently work in progress and we expect to launch in early 2027. You can follow our <strong>devlog</strong> on <strong>X</strong> or <strong>Bluesky</strong> (see links on the right hand side).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Please note all images and video are work in progress and not representative of the final quality of the product.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colonize The Solar System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colonize <strong>Mars</strong>, <strong>The Moon</strong> and other worlds of the <strong>Solar System</strong>. Each world posing a different and increasingly difficult challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine and Manufacture</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of in-situ resources in order to build a self sustaining colony. Harvest <strong>regolith</strong>, mine <strong>metals</strong>, establish <strong>manufacturing</strong> industries and do whatever it takes for your colony to <strong>survive</strong> and <strong>thrive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509420/extras/4956f566f935575545e673f784d71554.poster.avif?t=1753260847\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509420/extras/4956f566f935575545e673f784d71554.webm?t=1753260847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509420/extras/4956f566f935575545e673f784d71554.mp4?t=1753260847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harness the power of Nature</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect energy from whatever sources are available in each world. Develop the systems required to harvest and store energy from <strong>The Sun</strong>, <strong>Wind</strong>, <strong>Nuclear</strong> and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research Technologies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock both <strong>local</strong> and <strong>Earth-based</strong> technologies in order to build <strong>larger</strong> and <strong>more efficient colonies</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Construct Vehicles and Robots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manufacture or import <strong>vehicles</strong> and <strong>robots</strong> that will aid with the hardest tasks in the settlement and will increase your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509420/extras/0f25599eafcb1f867c94d7cdabbc38a7.avif?t=1753260847\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Layered Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated systems will allow you to manage your colony <strong>without micromanagement</strong> most of the time. However when the need arises you will be able to give <strong>specific commands</strong> to individuals, so they do what you need them to. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolved Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine a game with all the features of <strong>Planetbase</strong>, <strong>Dawn of Man</strong> and more. In particular we plan to add a <strong>tech tree</strong>, <strong>vehicles</strong>, and the ability to create <strong>separate bases</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Colonize the Solar System. Manage a base of near-future humans trying to survive on Mars, The Moon and the satellites of Jupiter and Saturn. Grow food, mine resources, manufacture goods and face all the challenges these remote worlds will throw at you.",
